@startuml
' Figure 26.2  A tool an agent can use well (class diagram)
' Reading order: the tool definition in the middle; its typed input
' above, its bounded result to the left, its error shape to the right,
' its registry entry below. Fields from gateway.design and
' gateway.servers.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
class Tool <<ops>> {
  +name
  +description
  +kind
}
class Input <<policy>> {
  +typed ids
  +no free text
}
class Result <<knowledge>> {
  +summary first
  +token cap
}
class Error <<evidence>> {
  +field
  +fix
}
class Entry <<knowledge>> {
  +owner, scopes
  +hash
}
Tool -up-> Input
Tool -left-> Result
Tool -right-> Error
Tool .down.> Entry
@enduml
